* 4-pole DIP switch SW2 (gain select).  Pole k joins pin k to pin 9-k; sel = the one pole that is ON (1..4).
.subckt DIP4_GAIN P1 P2 P3 P4 P5 P6 P7 P8 params: sel=2
R1 P1 P8 {1m + (sel != 1) * 1G}
R2 P2 P7 {1m + (sel != 2) * 1G}
R3 P3 P6 {1m + (sel != 3) * 1G}
R4 P4 P5 {1m + (sel != 4) * 1G}
.ends DIP4_GAIN
